// Ejemplo 4.1: Suma de un arreglo de 5 elementos
Load addr
Store next
Load num
Subt one
Store ctr
loop, Load sum
AddI next
Store sum
Load next
Add one
Store next
Load ctr
Subt one
Store ctr
SkipCond 000
Jump loop
Halt
addr, HEX 117
next, HEX 0
num, DEC 5
sum, DEC 0
ctr, HEX 0
one, DEC 1
DEC 10
DEC 15
DEC 20
DEC 25
DEC 30